0px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2318/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_The_Players_Tribune.jpg","The Players’ Tribune is a digital-first media company dedicated to empowering world-class athletes to share their stories with fans. Since launching in 2014, the platform has been the first to break some of the biggest stories in the world of sports thanks to its deep, intimate connection with the athlete community. With a network that includes greats from baseball, football, basketball and beyond, TPT serves as a reliable outlet in a world where narratives are often intentionally distorted and dominated by talking heads whose sole purpose is to scream louder than yesterday. In contrast, TPT offers thoughtful, high-quality and authentic content straight from the source. As a result of the trust it has built among both athletes and fans, The Players’ Tribune is becoming closer to the heartbeat of the game than nearly anyone else.","The Players' Tribune is the first content platform created, curated and controlled by athletes, providing one-of-a-kind insights into the world of sports.","The Players' Tribune - IVP Portfolio - VC for Digital Sports Media","The Players' Tribune - IVP Portfolio ","The first content platform created, curated, and controlled by athletes, providing unique insight into the daily sports c